## Develop

Enter the Nix shell with:

```sh
nix develop
```

Then run the tests with:

```sh
nox
```

To see the available sessions, run:

```sh
nox --list
```

To format the codebase:

```sh
nox -s format -- --fix
```

Project-specific nox sessions go in `noxfile_local.py`; `noxfile.py` is kept in
sync with the template by `copier update`.

